# Cloudflare Pages security headers for fluxtube.forklabs.cc.
#
# Format reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Scored A+ on securityheaders.com (was A — bumped by adding `preload`
# to HSTS, the COOP/COEP/CORP cross-origin family, the
# `interest-cohort=()` opt-out, the CSP `upgrade-insecure-requests`
# directive, and tightening `form-action` to `'none'`).
#
# Direct-to-subdomain visitors need this Pages project to emit its own
# HSTS regardless of whether the apex includeSubDomains is active (HSTS
# only kicks in after the first HTTPS visit to the domain that emits
# it). Same applies to COOP/COEP/CORP — these don't inherit from the
# apex; each subdomain has to set its own.
#
# Defaults Pages already sets (don't redeclare):
#   - x-content-type-options: nosniff
#   - referrer-policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
#   - HTTP → HTTPS 301 redirect
#
# Key notes specific to this site:
#   - CSP `script-src 'self'` and `style-src 'self' <fonts>`: no inline
#     script or style is allowed. astro.config.mjs makes the build emit
#     none: `build.inlineStylesheets: 'never'` writes page CSS to
#     /_astro/*.css, and `vite.build.assetsInlineLimit` keeps every
#     bundled <script> (the terminal type-in + countdown) as an external
#     module. `is:inline`, `define:vars` or a `style="…"` attribute in a
#     component would put inline content back, and this policy would
#     block it.
#   - COEP require-corp: Google Fonts (the only cross-origin resource
#     here) already serves CORP `cross-origin` + CORS `*`, so non-
#     breaking. Verified upstream.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
